      "content": "but that’s just what people say to feel better, isn't it? \"set an example\"? how can i set an example when i'm just a walking disaster? every time i try to fix something, i just make it worse for everyone around me. it's like i'm a parasite. the only way to actually stop the damage, the only way to make sure my sister doesn't have to deal with my failures, is to just... not be a factor anymore. it feels like the only selfless thing left to do is to let the line end here.",
